{"title":"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/395ae9da509f9922d790f242adeab5defdc036c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, \\dots , a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"100\" height=\"11\" /> are given. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/3/ed3c0e0875b8695a1e1e2bb48d8c5e73c4e5245f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le i\\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />) define\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/1/661c06518e6a3ae8ca5c84d0eb4e63ef7945723e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d_i=\\max\\{a_j:1\\le j\\le i\\}-\\min\\{a_j:i\\le j\\le n\\}\\]\" width=\"370\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>and let\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/7/677a05f003aa103531ff367920be9f9dd13797f8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[d=\\max\\{d_i:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>(a) Prove that, for any real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/8/71825596af68ec451a3f19a994f80bc3703769f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1\\le x_2\\le \\cdots\\le x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"14\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/a/a7ac71dcf18b9336f8b3d4cbb575615c1aefca54.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\ge \\dfrac{d}{2}   (*)\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"37\" /> \n</p><p>(b) Show that there are real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/787ef0f4ea06652fa96f55ccf88d7890d33858cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1\\le x_2\\le x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" /> such that equality holds in (*)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53a6fdbcdc01aacbfc61ab01b57885e9e9bf28f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_i=\\max\\{a_j:1\\le j\\le i\\}-\\min\\{a_j:i\\le j\\le n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"371\" height=\"18\" />, all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/5/f1544d77330dc5a289ad6a42beeb236b8dd70a9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"15\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a986a2184e64a2c88da694bc2ec8edf3cc772c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_p-a_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23a3ce21bb2667816e877940df568d1de2d6c84a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le p\\le i\\le q \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a986a2184e64a2c88da694bc2ec8edf3cc772c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_p-a_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef58cfb6a6785f15317c77152190c603b3c6e1aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\le p\\le q\\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"110\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><b>Lemma: </b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/6/1864404550590bf6a8839b5af287a0114bb3bb96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/c/77c86999a9055fd304aa1f9ae6805f9ea1dbae79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_p \\geq a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/80882127496d6aba349762b18b1a2057d9ec107f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i \\geq a_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> for some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> satisfying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d21ac09ed87346f488fee94f3d5c8e91fcd7a04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq i \\leq q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" /> it follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e9915b890e28d331201c141abcbd574c1cb01111.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><b>(a): </b>\n</p><p><b>Case </b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf241f417f15840faeb3eda1b152e2820be9165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=0:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791662898215b138613f4dada0a3ce54193d735f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/0/a1004223f873a6caccc0072d8b9bfc17356186a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"207\" height=\"20\" /> is the maximum of a set of non-negative number, which must be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><b>Case </b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/0/470673299bfefac7785a51d09a2f3218775e26e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d&gt;0:$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Assume for the sake of contradiction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/9/c495489eeeb5ea2cd3274b8aa361ff5b5a58a6f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}&lt;\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"241\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f5a0c0b2dc8f8f620de9278ab487144a74ff47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall i$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/e/aae0ca0d3930e91ca2b77961164a698d855f3bec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_i-a_i|&lt;\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"103\" height=\"39\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/1/2f1b1e47db39bc9222a6447cf1bac9ef444ddbf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_p-a_p|&lt;\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"103\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39e80170cdecd0a059e87b6923440cd7b7577fdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_q-a_q|&lt;\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"102\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994c5c171c9855a39dc07ed482656b66effbdff6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_p&gt;a_p-\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"93\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/f/d3f890341a892f15f0971bb3291eb0f380f31ec1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_q&lt;a_q+\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />. Subtracting the two inequalities we obtain\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/a/27a28b2112ba5c4a02727323cae94eca0e434e82.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_p-x_q&gt;a_p-a_q-d=a_p-a_q-a_p+a_q=0.\\]\" width=\"366\" height=\"18\" />\ni.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3ef9088120d650a0dedd3796e0f5c54c23769b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_p&gt;x_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> which contradicts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/7/6c76d98b6e58c41df03d113adff348249be09425.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_p\\le x_q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"59\" height=\"16\" /> (since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/5/665900a7470cc49da32c5450813c0afe07420899.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p \\leq q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />).\n</p><p><br />\nThus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1036011cc347e3e21152742bcfa16e742c19a7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\ge\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"245\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p><b>(b): </b>\n</p><p>A set of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc6daa9d6b964201d6cef60cbeb1ac5fd26ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> where equality holds in (*) is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/075c0148c36b7c85ffc79c07013a1e85b9396bbe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_i=\\max\\{a_j:1\\le j\\le i\\}-\\frac{d}{2}\\]\" width=\"229\" height=\"37\" />\nfor all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/4097088d5a3ceeb3f67539286c5eafdfa2caecc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{a_j:1\\le j\\le i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"18\" /> is a non-decreasing function, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc6daa9d6b964201d6cef60cbeb1ac5fd26ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> is non-decreasing.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/f/51f5a0c0b2dc8f8f620de9278ab487144a74ff47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall i$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"13\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d3430da4092ca68eca21aa17e1bc2de68a603e61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m_i}=\\max\\{a_j:1\\le j\\le i\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"210\" height=\"20\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/c/a3cf10172fa33d3f0967a4a855b1570fde5cab49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{m_i}-a_i&lt;a_{m_i}-\\min\\{a_j:i\\le j\\le n\\}=d_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"334\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/4/8842e0c455beebda6fb5bc1aa0e7ff9895564336.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0\\le a_{m_i}-a_i \\le d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"19\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/d/75d8ffa75c9a5f8f53e8406e0cce8ddfee3b4334.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0\\le a_{m_i}-a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1ddf57a1507686a49e3d290b3542ccac565cd35a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> is the max of a set including <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/412787c048e28774dc63fc27db42dc52ca858de7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" />).\n</p><p>Therefore one has\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/6/206be339cfc1fb18c430038fd74aea665946c23b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-\\dfrac{d}{2} \\le a_{m_i}-a_i - \\dfrac{d}{2} \\le \\dfrac{d}{2}\\]\" width=\"186\" height=\"37\" />\nhence\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/2/de21f4027378e644e1d5dcd1dc5381a0779e0471.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_i-a_i| = \\left|a_{m_i}- \\frac{d}{2} -a_i \\right| \\le \\frac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"240\" height=\"45\" />. Lastly since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/3/1036011cc347e3e21152742bcfa16e742c19a7a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\ge\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"245\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf3fa75a37ccaa285735c114196e4529d37d672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_i-a_i|\\le \\frac{d}{2} \\ \\forall i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"125\" height=\"39\" />, it follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecbc888c7ce053036ef9c2d1372d8c4d90e61940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\max\\{|x_i-a_i|:1\\le i\\le n\\}=\\dfrac{d}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"241\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This is written by Mo Lam--- who is a horrible proof writer, so please fix the proof for me. Thank you. O, also the formatting. \n</p><p>(edited by not_detriti)\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO\" title=\"2007 IMO\">2007 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li>&lt;url&gt;viewtopic.php?p=894656#p894656 Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks&lt;/url&gt;</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 324/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1211/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 10726/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   23.575      1 -total\n 69.79%   16.452      1 Template:IMO_box\n 29.64%    6.987      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8615:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017213732 and revision id 279323. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}